+/******************************************************************************/
+/*									      */
+/*                                CLEARBUF.HPP                                */
+/*									      */
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*									      */
+/*    Template functions to set a buffer of a fixed size to all NUL bytes     */
+/*									      */
+/*============================================================================*/
+/*									      */
+/*			 Written by Scott Dale Robison			      */
+/*									      */
