+/******************************************************************************/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                                 TYPES.HPP                                  */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                  Generic data types used by CDC projects.                  */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*============================================================================*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                       Written by Scott Dale Robison                        */
