+  asm  Sub  X2,Bx
+  asm  Inc  word ptr X2
+  asm  Mov  Cx,Y2
+  asm  Mov  Ax,Y1
+  asm  Sub  Cx,Ax
+  asm  Inc  Cx
+  asm  Mov  Bl,160
+  asm  Mul  Bl
+  asm  Inc  Ax
+  asm  Add  Si,Ax
+
+NextY:
+
+ForX:
+  asm  Push Cx
