+/******************************************************************************/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                                  MOVE.CPP                                  */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*        Functions to allow cursor movement within an @ code document        */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*============================================================================*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                       Written by Scott Dale Robison                        */
+/*                                                                            */
