+
+
+/******************************************************************************/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                                PCBEDIT.CPP                                 */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*       A program to allow easy editing of PCBoard files with @ codes.       */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*============================================================================*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                       Written by Scott Dale Robison                        */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
