-/********************************************************************
-*
-*  Function:  comparenames()
-*
-*  Desc    :  Used for the OnDisk and InList AVL trees, and also when sorting
-*             the OnDiskDupes and InListDupes datasets.
-*
-*  Returns :  an integer to indicate which filename should sort higher
